1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,763
The play opens at dawn in the yard of Laxminarayan, the king's bull doctor, who is grumbling that not one of his seven wives has brought him his hookah.

2
00:00:08,763 --> 00:00:13,359
The cowherds Jitman and Gore run in with the news: Male is dead.

3
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:19,101
All three are terrified; the king has threatened to punish anyone who lets the bull die.

